  "Rise, My Minions! (once per session, may make a Hard [[difficulty] [difficulty] [difficulty]] Mechanics or Medicine check [depending on the type of minions the arcane scientist has]; for each uncanceled [success], one incapacitated minion within medium range heals all wounds and rejoins the encounter; it may act in the current round).",
  :setting "weird-war",
  :wounds 14,
  :defense {:melee 0, :ranged 0},
  :talents
  "Adversary 2 (upgrade the difficulty of all combat checks against this target twice), Scathing Tirade (use this talent to make an Average [[difficulty] [difficulty]] Coercion check; for each [success], one opponent within short range suffers 1 strain; for each [advantage], one affected opponent suffers 1 additional strain).",
  :skills
  [{:name "Charm", :rank 2}
   {:name "Coercion", :rank 3}
   {:name "Discipline", :rank 3}
   {:name "Knowledge", :rank 3}
   {:name "Medicine", :rank 3}
   {:name "Ranged (Light)", :rank 1}],
  :id :arcane-scientist,
  :characteristics {"brawn" 1, "agility" 2, "intellect" 4, "cunning" 3, "willpower" 2, "presence" 2},
  :strain 18,
  :soak 1,
  :text
  "This profile presents an occult researcher who specializes in medical experimentation using arcane abilities. If you want, you can change out the Medicine skill for Mechanics to reflect a mad scientist who creates death rays and walking tanks as opposed to biological horrors."}
 {:name "Bane Spider",
  :equipment
  "Venomous fangs (Brawl; Damage 5; Critical 3; Range [Engaged]; Burn 2, Pierce 3), acid spit (Ranged; Damage 4; Critical 4; Range [Short]; Burn 2, Pierce 3) or webbing (Ranged; Damage 1; Critical 6; Range [Short]; Ensnare 3).",
  :type "rival",
  :source {:book "crb", :page 147},
  :abilities "Skitter (can move across walls, ceilings, and giant spider webs without penalty).",
  :setting "fantasy",
  :wounds 16,
  :defense {:melee 0, :ranged 0},
  :talents "None.",
  :skills
  [{:name "Brawl", :rank 2}
   {:name "Cool", :rank 2}
   {:name "Coordination", :rank 2}
   {:name "Ranged", :rank 1}
   {:name "Stealth", :rank 2}
   {:name "Vigilance", :rank 3}],
  :id :bane-spider,
  :characteristics {"brawn" 4, "agility" 3, "intellect" 1, "cunning" 2, "willpower" 1, "presence" 1},
  :soak 5,
  :text
  "Giant spiders are a mainstay of the fantasy genre. As horrifying as any huge arachnid, bane spiders have the added ability to spit globs of acidic venom. This venom, which bane spiders can also inject with their fangs, conveniently allows them to start digesting their prey before even closing to striking range. Most bane spiders are roving hunters, but you might prefer one that shoots bundles of sticky webbing instead of (or in addition to) venom."}
 {:name "Beastman",
  :equipment "Fangs and claws (Brawl; Damage 6; Critical 3; Range [Engaged]).",
  :type "minion",
  :source {:book "crb", :page 147},
  :abilities
